WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
(ambient music)

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.669
- [Voiceover] I was
raised by a single mom.

00:00:11.669 --> 00:00:13.709
Lately, I've been thinking
about how I'll move out

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:15.579
one day and I get so upset.

00:00:15.579 --> 00:00:17.019
I love her more than anything,

00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:19.389
and I can't imagine leaving her all alone.

00:00:19.389 --> 00:00:22.139
- [Voiceover] I was raised by
a single mom and four sisters.

00:00:22.139 --> 00:00:24.788
They never stressed about
teaching me to be a real man,

00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:27.269
but they did value me being a good person.

00:00:27.269 --> 00:00:29.909
And ya know what, I'm
proud of the man I am.

00:00:29.909 --> 00:00:32.099
- [Voiceover] My dad is a single parent.

00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:34.000
Mom left us when I was a baby.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.149
But you know what? I really am fortunate.

00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:37.889
My dad is so inspiring.

00:00:37.889 --> 00:00:39.400
He's tough and caring.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.179
He's taught me what it truly
means to be an amazing parent.

00:00:42.179 --> 00:00:44.189
- [Voiceover] Grew up with a single mom.

00:00:44.189 --> 00:00:46.730
She teaches us to cook and work on cars.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.339
We call her Wonder Woman and she loves it.

00:00:49.339 --> 00:00:51.549
- [Voiceover] My dad is
the best part of my life.

00:00:51.549 --> 00:00:53.491
Alone, he's raising my baby sister and I,

00:00:53.491 --> 00:00:55.579
all while serving 10
plus years in the Navy.

00:00:55.579 --> 00:00:56.979
He's just the best.

00:00:56.979 --> 00:00:58.509
- [Voiceover] My dad has had a hard life

00:00:58.509 --> 00:01:00.611
and is still the kindest man I know.

00:01:00.611 --> 00:01:03.931
One day soon, I have to provide
him with a life he deserves.

00:01:03.931 --> 00:01:05.789
It is my biggest goal.

00:01:05.789 --> 00:01:07.698
- [Voiceover] My mom is a single parent

00:01:07.698 --> 00:01:10.600
who took care of us kids while
working and going to college.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.179
I can't think of a better
example of a hero than her.

00:01:14.179 --> 00:01:16.762
(upbeat music)

